WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:07,940
The signal from buoy No. B17 was cut off.

2
00:00:07,940 --> 00:00:09,510
what does it mean

3
00:00:09,510 --> 00:00:11,670
Maybe the buoy was completely repaired and damaged.

4
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:13,930
Can it still be positioned?

5
00:00:13,930 --> 00:00:16,930
You can only drive past him according to the last left mark before he disappeared.

6
00:00:16,930 --> 00:00:44,200
No one was seen on the water

7
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:45,650
Get into the water and walk

8
00:01:22,840 --> 00:01:23,840
No spontaneous breathing

9
00:01:23,840 --> 00:01:25,940
No pulse to save him

10
00:01:25,940 --> 00:01:28,670
Give me the divine code to save him

11
00:01:28,670 --> 00:01:30,760
open your eyes
